<%# Dev only (Tim, 2026-11-01): a thin amber line across the top and a small
    tab naming the environment, so dev is never mistaken for production. It
    takes no space and passes every click through. Never pink or black, which
    belong to the mode switch and the door bars. Not on the app's
    organization sheet: it slides up over a page that already wears the
    ribbon (Tim, 2026-11-09). %>
<% on_sheet = turbo_native_app? && current_page?(organization_menu_path) %>
<% if !on_sheet && (label = Dev::EnvironmentLabel.text) %>
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-[9999] h-[3px] bg-amber-400"></div>
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none fixed top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-[9999] rounded-b-md bg-amber-400 px-2 pb-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider leading-4 text-amber-950 shadow-sm"><%= label %></div>
<% end %>
